abstract: "The Golden Triangle Method is an open-source framework for building privacy-preserving blockchain systems by systematically combining three foundational pillars: Mathematics (ZK-SNARKs/Groth16), Secure Logic (Move Language), and High-Performance Computation (Rust). This architecture addresses fundamental failures of previous privacy solutions by ensuring cryptographic soundness, asset security, and practical performance."
